              "text": "మాట్లాడు (māṭlāḍu) — \"speak\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From māṭa, 'word', plus āḍu, 'to play' — the same construction as Kannada's mātāḍu, built from the same two pieces."
            }
          ]
        },
